    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Jackie Hart, a paranormal investigator, \u00a0as she navigates a chilling mystery set in the shadowy streets and rooftops of modern Taiwan. A gruesome discovery on a hotel roof leads to a tangled web of ritualistic sacrifices, ancient folklore, and unearthly entities each with their own motivations and plans for Jackie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509730/extras/6c43dd84c0faf507bf8250c5b1933913.poster.avif?t=1748432038\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509730/extras/6c43dd84c0faf507bf8250c5b1933913.webm?t=1748432038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509730/extras/6c43dd84c0faf507bf8250c5b1933913.mp4?t=1748432038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>2D point &amp; click adventure</strong>, you'll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate Disturbing Crime Scenes</strong>: Examine eerie environments, piece together  clues, and reconstruct events to unravel the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Deep, Choice-Driven Dialogue</strong>: Interact with a cast of richly developed characters, from skeptical police officers to enigmatic shamans, where your decisions shape the narrative and relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Taiwan's Mystical Lore</strong>: Delve into indigenous rituals, encounter spirits, and face the terrifying yaoguai, as you uncover secrets rooted in cultural mythology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strengthen Your Abilities:</strong>\u00a0Meet powerful allies in the world of mysticism and magic who can unlock your latent powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509730/extras/18a014996bf7fcbc67b41a67ef9ca67f.poster.avif?t=1748432038\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509730/extras/18a014996bf7fcbc67b41a67ef9ca67f.webm?t=1748432038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509730/extras/18a014996bf7fcbc67b41a67ef9ca67f.mp4?t=1748432038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the  secret behind Jackie's powers? Will she embrace the darkness or step into the light? Your choices will determine not only the outcome of the investigation but the fates of those around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling narrative with multiple dialogue paths and moral dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully hand-drawn 2D environments inspired by the rich culture and urban landscapes of Taiwan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by an outstanding cast.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to be drawn into a world where every choice matters, every clue counts, and every shadow could hide your next threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong> and uncover the truth.</p>",
